</problem></exercise><exercise id="fs-id2935749"><problem id="fs-id2935751">
<para id="fs-id2935753"><emphasis effect="bold">Dhuwur</emphasis> Ing Colorado ana luwih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>50</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> gunung nganggo dhuwur luwih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14,000</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>foot.</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> Tabel iki nuduhake sepuluh gunung paling dhuwur. gunakna tabel iki kanggo ngisi tandha pertidaksamaan sing cocog.
<table id="fs-id2935762" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel iki ana sewelas larik lan rong kolom. Larik kapisan sirah tabel kanthi label ‘Gunung’ lan ‘Dhuwur’. Jeneng gununge Mt. Elbert, Mt. Massive, Mt. Harvard, Blanca Peak, La Plata Peak, Uncompahgre Peak, Crestone Peak, Mt. Lincoln, Grays Peak, lan Mt. Antero. Dhuwure 14,433, 14,421, 14,420, 14,345, 14,336, 14,309, 14,294, 14,286, 14,270, lan 14,269 foot.">
